## Context

This component enables "Buy Now" functionality on product pages. Unlike checkout page Express Checkout which uses an existing cart/payment session, product page Express Checkout must:
1. Create a new cart (or use existing)
2. Add the selected product variant
3. Initiate a payment session
4. Process the payment
All within the Express Checkout flow.

**Blocked by:** EXP-003 (Button Component)

